/Title (Project Overview: This experiment aims to learn calibration methods and techniques using known input values. We took loading and unloading measurements at five input levels for each instrument and calculated the average outputs. We used the method of least squares to determine the correlation coefficients and standard errors, and used the regression line to find the calibration equations for the loading, unloading, and average data sets.)
