/Title (Using the joint angles [0 45 -70 20 0 -15], I calculated the Jacobian matrix and its eigenvalues and eigenvectors. Figure 1 shows the velocity manipulability ellipsoid, where the longer axes represent directions with better motion capability and the shorter axes represent more limited movement. Figure 2 shows the resulting joint configuration, while Figure 3 displays the calculated Jacobian, eigenvalues, eigenvectors, and principal motion gains.)
